idth="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="14.75" cy="9" r=".5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></button></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-skeleton-bg/50 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:-translate-x-full before:-skew-x-12 before:animate-[skeletonShimmer_2s_infinite] before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-transparent before:via-skeleton-bg before:to-transparent w-[70%] h-[18px] my-2"></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-skeleton-bg/50 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:-translate-x-full before:-skew-x-12 before:animate-[skeletonShimmer_2s_infinite] before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-transparent before:via-skeleton-bg before:to-transparent w-[30%] h-[18px]"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full pt-8"><h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="w-full" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_25pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_5pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; prediction market?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_25pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_5pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">&quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; is a prediction market on Polymarket where traders buy and sell &quot;Yes&quot; or &quot;No&quot; shares based on whether they believe this event will happen. The current crowd-sourced probability is 0% for &quot;Yes.&quot; For example, if &quot;Yes&quot; is priced at 0¢, the market collectively assigns a 0% chance that this event will occur. These odds shift continuously as traders react to new developments and information. Shares in the correct outcome are redeemable for $1 each upon market resolution.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_29pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_9pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">How much trading activity has &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; generated on Polymarket?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_29pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_9pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">As of today, &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; has generated $13.8 million in total trading volume since the market launched on Sep 18, 2024. This level of trading activity reflects strong engagement from the Polymarket community and helps ensure that the current odds are informed by a deep pool of market participants. You can track live price movements and trade on any outcome directly on this page.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">How do I trade on &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot;?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">To trade on &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?,&quot; simply choose whether you believe the answer is &quot;Yes&quot; or &quot;No.&quot; Each side has a current price that reflects the market&#x27;s implied probability. Enter your amount and click &quot;Trade.&quot; If you buy &quot;Yes&quot; shares and the outcome resolves as &quot;Yes,&quot; each share pays out $1. If it resolves as &quot;No,&quot; your &quot;Yes&quot; shares pay $0. You can also sell your shares at any time before resolution if you want to lock in a profit or cut a loss.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the current odds for &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot;?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">The current probability for &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; is 0% for &quot;Yes.&quot; This means the Polymarket crowd currently believes there is a 0% chance that this event will occur. These odds update in real-time based on actual trades, providing a continuously updated signal of what the market expects to happen.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2lpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_lpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">How will &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; be resolved?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2lpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_lpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">The resolution rules for &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; define exactly what needs to happen for each outcome to be declared a winner — including the official data sources used to determine the result. You can review the complete resolution criteria in the &quot;Rules&quot; section on this page above the comments. We recommend reading the rules carefully before trading, as they specify the precise conditions, edge cases, and sources that govern how this market is settled.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2ppb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_ppb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I follow &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; without placing a trade?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2ppb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_ppb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">Yes. You don&#x27;t need to trade to stay informed. This page serves as a live tracker for &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?.&quot; The outcome probabilities update in real-time as new trades come in. You can bookmark this page and check the comments section to see what other traders are saying. You can also use the time-range filters on the chart to see how the odds have shifted over time. It&#x27;s a free, real-time window into what the market expects to happen.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2tpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_tpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">Why are Polymarket&#x27;s odds for &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; considered reliable?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2tpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_tpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">Polymarket odds are set by real traders putting real money behind their beliefs, which tends to surface accurate predictions. With $13.8 million traded on “Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?,” these prices aggregate the collective knowledge and conviction of thousands of participants — often outperforming polls, expert forecasts, and traditional surveys. Prediction markets like Polymarket have a strong track record of accuracy, especially as events approach their resolution date. For example, Polymarket has a one month accuracy score of 94%. For the latest stats on Polymarket’s prediction accuracy, visit the <a class="underline hover:text-text-secondary" href="/accuracy">accuracy page</a> on Polymarket.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_31pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_11pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">How do I start trading on &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot;?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_31pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_11pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">To place your first trade on &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?,&quot; sign up for a free Polymarket account and fund it using crypto, a credit or debit card, or a bank transfer. Once your account is funded, return to this page, select the outcome you want to trade, enter your amount, and click &quot;Trade.&quot; If you&#x27;re new to prediction markets, click the &quot;How it works&quot; link at the top of any Polymarket page for a quick step-by-step walkthrough of how trading works.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_35pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_15pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">What does a price of 0¢ for &quot;Yes&quot; mean?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_35pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_15pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">On Polymarket, the price of &quot;Yes&quot; or &quot;No&quot; represents the market&#x27;s implied probability. A &quot;Yes&quot; price of 0¢ for &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; means traders collectively believe there is a 0% chance this event will happen. If you buy &quot;Yes&quot; at 0¢ and the event does happen, you receive $1.00 per share — a profit of 100¢ per share. If the event doesn&#x27;t happen, those shares are worth $0.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_39pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_19pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">When does the &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; market close?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_39pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_19pb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">The &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; market has been resolved. The final result has been determined and the market is no longer open for trading. You can still review the historical odds, outcome probabilities, and comments on this page to see how predictions evolved over time.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_3dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">What are traders saying about &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot;?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_3dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1dpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">The &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?&quot; market has an active community of 3,138 comments where traders share their analysis, debate outcomes, and discuss breaking developments. Scroll down to the comments section below to read what other participants think. You can also filter by &quot;Top Holders&quot; to see what the market&#x27;s biggest traders are positioned on, or check the &quot;Activity&quot; tab for a real-time feed of trades.</div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0" style="display:none"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_3hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 lg:py-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors group cursor-pointer text-start" data-radix-collection-item="">What is Polymarket?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="shrink-0 ml-4 transform transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180"><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_3hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1hpb5d4bdd7l9lbm_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden data-[state=open]:animate-accordionSlideDown data-[state=closed]:animate-accordionSlideUp data-[state=closed]:h-0 data-[state=closed]:opacity-0" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="pb-5 lg:pb-6 text-[14px] text-text-primary leading-relaxed">Polymarket is the world&#x27;s largest prediction market, where you can stay informed and profit from your knowledge of real-world events. Traders buy and sell shares on outcomes for topics ranging from politics and elections to crypto, finance, sports, tech, and culture, including markets like &quot;Will Israel invade Lebanon in September?.&quot; Prices reflect real-time, crowd-sourced probabilities backed by financial conviction, often providing faster and more accurate signals than polls, pundits, or traditional surveys.</div></div></div></div><button type="button" class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 text-[14px] text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer"><span>View more</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12px" height="12px" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="transform transition-transform duration-200 "><polyline points="1.75 4.25 6 8.5 10.25 4.25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></polyline></svg></button></section></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fresnel-container fresnel-greaterThanOrEqual-lg fresnel-_R_dd4bdd7l9lbm_ contents"></div></div><div class="fresnel-container fresnel-greaterThanOrEqual-lg fresnel-_R_2d4bdd7l9lbm_ contents"></div></div></main><div class="flex flex-col w-[372px] sticky top-0 not-lg:hidden"><div></div></div></div></div><footer class="w-fu