olymarket","liquidityTitle":"Explore the most liquid Popular Polymarkets | Polymarket","newestTitle":"Explore the newest Popular Polymarkets | Polymarket","searchResultsDescription":"Search results for \"{query}\" on Polymarket prediction markets","tagDescription":"Browse all {tag} prediction markets on Polymarket","defaultDescription":"Search and discover prediction markets on Polymarket"},"predictionsHub":{"title":"Popular Predictions \u0026 Real-Time Odds | Polymarket","description":"Explore thousands of live predictions with real-time odds on politics, sports, crypto, world events, and more. Track or trade on outcomes on The World's Largest Prediction Market™"},"predictionsPage":{"title":"{tag} Predictions \u0026 Real-Time Odds | Polymarket","description":"Explore the latest {tag} predictions on Polymarket as of {date}. Track real-time odds and trade on The World's Largest Prediction Market™","liveDescription":"Explore {activeMarketCount} live {tag} prediction markets as of {date}. Track real-time odds and trade on The World's Largest Prediction Market™","resolvedDescription":"Explore the latest resolved {tag} prediction markets on Polymarket as of {date} on The World's Largest Prediction Market™"},"financeMeta":{"description":"Finance prediction markets for stocks, earnings, indices, commodities, and macro events on Polymarket."},"cryptoMeta":{"description":"Real-time crypto prediction markets. Trade on Bitcoin, Ethereum, and cryptocurrency price movements. Live odds updated every 15 minutes."},"weatherMeta":{"description":"Explore live {category} prediction markets as of {date}. Track real-time odds and trade on The World's Largest Prediction Market™"},"structuredData":{"orgDescription":"The world's largest prediction market platform","webAppDescription":"Trade on real-world events on The World's Largest Prediction Market","featureRealTimeMarkets":"Real-time prediction markets","featureCryptoTrading":"Cryptocurrency-based trading","featureMarketCreation":"Market creation tools","featurePortfolioManagement":"Portfolio management","eventDescription":"View real-time odds for \"{title}\" and trade on The World's Largest Prediction Market™","datasetName":"Polymarket Historical Prediction Accuracy","datasetDescription":"Historical data on prediction market outcomes and accuracy","howToName":"How to Trade on Polymarket","howToDescription":"Learn how to trade prediction markets using Polymarket","howToSupply":"Web browser and crypto wallet","stepCreateAccountName":"Create an Account","stepCreateAccountText":"Sign up for a Polymarket account using email or wallet","stepFundAccountName":"Fund Your Account","stepFundAccountText":"Deposit USDC into your Polymarket account","stepBrowseMarketsName":"Browse Markets","stepBrowseMarketsText":"Explore available prediction markets","stepPlaceTradeName":"Place a Trade","stepPlaceTradeText":"Buy shares in the outcome you predict","sportsEventName":"{away} vs {home}","sportsEventDescription":"Predict the winner of {away} vs {home}. View real-time odds and trade on Polymarket.","predictionMarketTrading":"Prediction market trading","discussionHeadline":"{title} — Discussion","discussionText":"Discussion about {title}. Traders share insights and predictions on Polymarket."},"metaDescription":{"resolved":"{title} (Resolved): View final results and past odds on The World's Largest Prediction Market™","viewRealTimeOdds":"View real-time odds for \"{title}\" as of {date} and trade on The World's Largest Prediction Market™","viewRealTimeOddsWithVolume":"{volume} has traded on \"{title}\" as of {date}. View real-time odds or trade on The World's Largest Prediction Market™"},"categoryFaq":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions","q1":{"q":"What is Polymarket?","a":"Polymarket is the world's largest prediction market, where users trade on the real-world outcomes of events across {categoryLabel} and many other topics. Prices are quoted from 0 to 100 cents and reflect the implied probability that an event will occur. Because traders put real money behind their views, Polymarket odds represent a real-time, skin-in-the-game consensus, often referred to as the \"wisdom of the crowd.\""},"q2":{"q":"What is a {marketLabel} prediction market?","aOutcome":"A {marketLabel} prediction market lets users trade Yes or No shares on a specific question tied to {marketLabel}-related events, such as {featuredMarket1}. Each share pays out $1 if the outcome resolves in its favor, and $0 if it does not. The current share price, for example, {topOutcomePct} on {topOutcome}, reflects the market's implied probability for that outcome at any given moment.","aChance":"A {marketLabel} prediction market lets users trade Yes or No shares on a specific question tied to {marketLabel}-related events, such as {featuredMarket1}. Each share pays out $1 if the outcome resolves in its favor, and $0 if it does not. The current share price, for example, {topOutcomePct} in {featuredMarket1}, reflects the market's implied probability at any given moment.","aGeneric":"A {marketLabel} prediction market lets users trade Yes or No shares on specific questions tied to {marketLabel}-related events. Each share pays out $1 if the outcome resolves in its favor, and $0 if it does not."},"q3":{"q":"What topics can I trade on in the {categoryLabel} category?","aWithSubcategories":"The {categoryLabel} category hosts {totalMarketCount} markets covering a wide range of subjects. Popular subcategories include {topSubcategories}, each with its own dedicated page showing live odds, trading volume, and active markets. You can browse the full list of {categoryLabel} subcategories from the left-side navigation on the {categoryLabel} page.","aGeneric":"The {categoryLabel} category hosts {totalMarketCount} markets covering a wide range of subjects. You can browse the available {categoryLabel} subcategories from the left-side navigation on the {categoryLabel} page to see live odds, trading volume, and active markets."},"q4":{"q":"How do {categoryLabel} odds on Polymarket work?","aOutcome":"Every {categoryLabel} market on Polymarket has outcomes priced between 0¢ and 100¢. That price is the implied probability of the outcome occurring. For example, if {topOutcome} is trading at {topOutcomePct} in {featuredMarket1}, traders are collectively pricing in roughly that probability. Prices update continuously as new information, data releases, and events move trader sentiment.","aChance":"Every {categoryLabel} market on Polymarket has outcomes priced between 0¢ and 100¢. That price is the implied probability of the outcome occurring. For example, if {featuredMarket1} is trading at {topOutcomePct}, traders are collectively pricing in roughly that probability. Prices update continuously as new information, data releases, and events move trader sentiment.","aGeneric":"Every {categoryLabel} market on Polymarket has outcomes priced between 0¢ and 100¢. That price is the implied probability of the outcome occurring, and prices update continuously as new information, data releases, and events move trader sentiment."},"q5":{"q":"Which {marketLabel} markets are most active right now?","aSpecificOne":"Activity is constantly shifting, but you can sort the page by 24-hour volume to see where trading is concentrated. Currently, {top24hVolumeMarket} is among the most actively traded markets on the {marketLabel} page, alongside another high-volume market like {featuredMarket1}.","aSpecificTwo":"Activity is constantly shifting, but you can sort the page by 24-hour volume to see where trading is concentrated. Currently, {top24hVolumeMarket} is among the most actively traded markets on the {marketLabel} page, alongside other high-volume markets like {featuredMarket1} and {featuredMarket2}.","aGeneric":"Activity is constantly shifting, but you can sort the page by 24-hour volume to see where trading is concentrated in real time."},"q6":{"q":"How are {categoryLabel} prediction markets resolved?","a":"Each {categoryLabel} market has a clearly defined resolution source and criteria published on the market page. When the event concludes, for example, when a result is officially reported, a deadline passes, or an authoritative source confirms the outcome, the market resolves and winning shares pay out $1 each. Markets in categories such as Elections, Economy, and Geopolitics typically rely on official government, regulatory, or primary-source reporting for resolution."},"q7":{"q":"Why do {categoryLabel} odds change so often?","aSpecific":"{categoryLabel} markets respond in real time to news, announcements, data releases, and policy shifts. A single development, such as a new poll, economic indicator, court ruling, or geopolitical event, can materially change the implied probability of an outcome. Looking at markets like {featuredMarket1}, price movements reflect traders continuously updating their views as fresh information arrives.","aGeneric":"{categoryLabel} markets respond in real time to news, announcements, data releases, and policy shifts. A single development, such as a new poll, economic indicator, court ruling, or geopolitical event, can materially change the implied probability of an outcome."},"q8":{"q":"How many {categoryLabel} markets are on Polymarket?","aWithSubcategory":"Polymarket currently lists {totalMarketCount} markets in the {categoryLabel} category, with {subcategoryMarketCount} of those in {subcategoryLabel} alone. The left-side navigation shows live market counts for every subcategory, including {topSubcategories}, so you can quickly see where coverage is deepest.","aGeneric":"Polymarket currently lists {totalMarketCount} markets in the {categoryLabel} category. The left-side navigation shows live market counts for each available subcategory so you can quickly see where coverage is deepest."},"q9":{"q":"Can I trade on future {categoryLabel} events before they happen?","aSpecificOne":"Yes. Most {categoryLabel} markets are designed to let users trade well ahead of the underlying event, from short-horizon weekly markets to long-dated markets covering outcomes months or years away. An example currently listed is {featuredMarket1}, which lets traders take positions as new information emerges over the life of the market.","aSpecificTwo":"Yes. Most {categoryLabel} markets are designed to let users trade well ahead of the underlying event, from short-horizon weekly markets to long-dated markets covering outcomes months or years away. Examples currently listed include {featuredMarket1} and {featuredMarket2}, which let traders take positions as new information emerges over the life of the market.","aGeneric":"Yes. Most {categoryLabel} markets are designed to let users trade well ahead of the underlying event, from short-horizon weekly markets to long-dated markets covering outcomes months or years away."},"q10":{"q":"Are Polymarket's {categoryLabel} odds more accurate than polls or forecasts?","a":"Prediction markets and traditional forecasts, such as polls, models, or analyst estimates, are complementary tools. Because Polymarket traders are risking real capital, {categoryLabel} odds aggregate many participants' information and incentives into a single probability, a mechanism that has historically tracked real-world outcomes closely in domains like Elections, Economy, and Geopolitics. That said, no market is a guarantee; odds represent trader consensus at a point in time, not a prediction of what will happen."},"q11":{"q":"How do I start trading {categoryLabel} markets on Polymarket?","aWithSubcategories":"You can browse the {categoryLabel} page to see active markets, open any market such as {featuredMarket1} to view its order book and full rules, and then trade Yes or No shares once your account is funded. The left-side navigation makes it easy to drill into subcategories like {topSubcat1} or {topSubcat2} to focus on the topics you follow most closely.","aGeneric":"You can browse the {categoryLabel} page to see active markets, open any market to view its order book and full rules, and then trade Yes or No shares once your account is funded."},"q12":{"q":"What moves {marketLabel} prediction market prices?","aSpecific":"{marketLabel} markets are driven by the same catalysts that move the underlying real-world story: official announcements, scheduled events and deadlines, data and reporting, and major news. For a market like {featuredMarket1}, watch for upcoming dates, related {categoryLabel} releases, and shifts in the broader {topSubcat1} and {topSubcat2} markets, all of which can change the implied probability traders assign to each outcome.","aGeneric":"{marketLabel} markets are driven by the same kinds of catalysts that move the underlying real-world story: official announcements, scheduled events and deadlines, data and reporting, and major news."},"q13":{"q":"Where can I see live {categoryLabel} odds and trading volume?","aSpecificOne":"Every market card on {pageLabelScope} pages displays the current implied probability for each outcome along with 24-hour or cumulative trading volume. For deeper detail, including price history, the order book, and full resolution rules, click into any individual market such as {featuredMarket1}.","aSpecificTwo":"Every market card on {pageLabelScope} pages displays the current implied probability for each outcome along with 24-hour or cumulative trading volume. For deeper detail, including price history, the order book, and full resolution rules, click into any individual market such as {featuredMarket1} or {top24hVolumeMarket}.","aGeneric":"Every market card on these pages displays the current implied probability for each outcome along with trading volume. For deeper detail, including price history, the order book, and full resolution rules, click into any individual market card."}}},"trading":{"buy":"Buy","sell":"Sell","yes":"Yes","no":"No","market":"Market","limit":"Limit","trade":"Trade","merge":"Merge","split":"Split","buying":"Buying","selling":